Notice: this tool (u-cli-mod) downloads the Unity Editor CLI binary and the
com.unity.pipeline package from Unity's official endpoints at runtime and
applies compatibility patches locally. Those downloaded assets are governed by
their own license terms (Unity Package Distribution License and Unity CLI
terms). They are NOT distributed with this package and never land in this
repository. This MIT license covers only the tool code in this repository.